Open Vanilla 0017: custom strategy names and lines are safe in SQL. The bot AI's custom strategies
(.bot cmd <you> nc +custom::<name>, and the cs editor) put the name and line from player chat
straight into SQL; a quote in them could stall or change the characters database. Names are now
letters, digits and _ only (up to 64), and an edited line is escaped. File in the PlayerBots module.

